WEBVTT

00:01.254 --> 00:03.831
Landing page on Stellar TESTNET: one button, no password, no app, no XLM.

00:03.831 --> 00:13.689
Tap 'Kumbaranı aç': the passkey (Face ID) creates the key; the relay deploys the smart account.

00:13.689 --> 00:27.065
Savings screen: the kumbara exists on-chain, TESTNET address with a stellar.expert link.

00:27.065 --> 00:29.907
Spending limit (1,000 USDC per transaction) installed in the background; Deposit unlocks.

00:29.907 --> 00:32.201
Deposit: 100 TRY, indicative USDC quote from the anchor.

00:32.201 --> 00:37.475
IBAN screen: bank details and the reference TRMA-FZ8N-JFR3 the visitor puts in the transfer description.

00:37.475 --> 00:37.975
Presenter plays the bank on /booth/admin (sandbox transfer); the app detects the lira.

00:37.485 --> 00:39.493
Status: Transferin bekleniyor

00:39.493 --> 00:51.540
Status: Liran alındı, USDC gönderiliyor

00:51.540 --> 00:57.561
Status: Anchor USDC'yi gönderiyor

00:57.561 --> 01:09.605
Status: USDC kumbarana taşınıyor

01:09.605 --> 01:17.637
Status: Neredeyse bitti

01:17.637 --> 01:29.674
Status: USDC kumbarana ulaştı; kasaya konuyor

01:29.674 --> 01:30.174
Status: Tamam. USDC kasada.

01:29.676 --> 01:35.257
USDC went anchor → bridge account → kumbara → DeFindex vault; three TESTNET transaction links.

01:35.257 --> 01:41.004
Savings shows the vault balance and its lira equivalent (Reflector rate).

01:41.004 --> 01:44.317
Withdraw: 1 USDC, sell quote in lira; the payout goes to the visitor's IBAN.

01:44.317 --> 02:00.375
Status: Hazırlanıyor

02:00.375 --> 02:16.427
Status: Kasadan çekiliyor ve gönderiliyor (iki Face ID onayı)

02:16.427 --> 02:26.463
Status: USDC anchor'a gönderiliyor

02:26.463 --> 02:34.490
Status: Anchor liraya çeviriyor

02:34.490 --> 02:34.990
Status: Tamam. Lira IBAN'ına gönderildi.

02:34.491 --> 02:37.545
Payout po_mh1q2bt1jopbxazo5kka: vault withdrawal, transfer through the reverse bridge account, anchor FAST payout (simulated).

02:37.545 --> 02:39.663
Back on Savings: the remaining USDC stays in the vault. End of the round trip.
